From eee20419d1bd848d7a6283b39fb8874b15f416e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dameng <dameng@local>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:38:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] EDBT v4 B5 (Phase B2): shared all-storage initial candidates
 + all-policy typed-counter observation + single-client measured diagnostic
 pass
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

B2-2 shared all-storage initial candidate enumerator: PlanAnalyzer::analyze()
now builds EVERY policy's initial candidate set from the full store
(analyze_by_frequency, sealed chunks only — mirroring the daemon's per-cycle
scan exactly) and overlays the audited LQP access_type / cardinality onto
referenced segments for plan-aware arms (resolve_segments' chunk-pruning
semantics preserved). Unreferenced segments remain candidates with
access_type=Unknown. our_full initial set 4718 -> 7392 = our_freq = daemon
set; initial/daemon candidate-set hashes identical across policies.

B2-4 typed-counter observation for ALL policies: the daemon enumeration reads
the five raw cumulative pattern counters + calibration dtype/bytes-per-value
unconditionally (cost aggregation remains cost_c3_greedy-only, whose
calibration table is only loaded there). Every decision-trace row of every
policy now carries sequential/monotonic/random/point/dictionary counts;
non-c3 rows use dictionary_handling=observed_not_scored and empty costs.

B2-5 single-client measured diagnostic pass (--placement_trace_measured,
default off; CLI-gated to --placement_trace + --clients 1): runs after the
initial placement, before the daemon starts. Per query: counter snapshot ->
own-pipeline execution -> snapshot; deltas are exact per-execution
measurements (measured_per_execution). Emits <json>_measured_segment_access.csv
and appends measured operator rows to the operator trace (rows/wall from the
executed PQPs' performance data). actual_reads is filled only under the
unique-scan attribution rule (exactly one TableScan of that query references
the segment's (table,column)); otherwise null. clients=10 mechanism runs
never enable this path (execute_item exposes statement-level metrics only —
no per-operator data; documented in POLICY_SPEC).

Preflight (our_full, trace+measured, clients=1, 30s): placement 7392
(369 Local / 7023 CXL); trace tail columns populated for our_full;
95,528 measured segment rows; 1,987,067 measured operator rows (389 with
non-null actual_reads).
